<title>UK: Reckitt gains after Unilever results.</title>
<headline>Reckitt gains after Unilever results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share in consumer products group Reckitt &amp; Colman Plc were propelled higher on Friday in the wake of better-than-expected results from Unilever Plc, traders said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 15-1/2p at 705 by 0900 GMT in modest volume of 201,829 shares, after yesterday closing at a two-month low. Unilever was up 47-1/2p at 13.22-1/2 in volume of 1.4 million.  </p>
<p>&quot;It is a reaction to the Unilever results,&quot; said one market-maker in Reckitt shares. &quot;Plus they got banged yesterday along with everything else.&quot;</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
